# Authored invariants for the replay fixture (Plane B).

invariant invariant.replay.analysis-only
  rule: Replay canonicalization is consumed by analysis tools only, never by the live client.
  link: inv:replay-never-feeds-live
  tag: critical

invariant invariant.live.pins-authoritative
  rule: The live client never acts on a message name absent from the pinned build.
  link: inv:live-pins-are-authoritative
  tag: critical

invariant invariant.protocol.module-reviewed
  rule: Any edit of the protocol pin module is reviewed by the protocol owner.
  file: packages/protocol/src/pins.ts

invariant invariant.decision.deterministic
  rule: Decision scoring is deterministic for identical inputs.
